# StarCraft: holding LB lays the control-group keys over the face buttons; RB holds Shift.
setup packs/starcraft.padpack Gameplay
tap south 40
press lb
tap south 40
tap west 40
release lb
press rb
tap south 40
release rb
---
key KEY_A down              @0
key KEY_A up                @40
shifts mode - layers Groups @40
overlay none + info 1       @40
key KEY_1 down              @40
key KEY_1 up                @80
key KEY_2 down              @80
key KEY_2 up                @120
shifts mode - layers -      @120
overlay none                @120
key KEY_LEFTSHIFT down      @120
key KEY_A down              @120
key KEY_A up                @160
key KEY_LEFTSHIFT up        @160
